    a person.\nDo not reduce a client to one moment, one choice, or one emotion.\n\nRespect
    Personal Choice\nThe client decides how to face and understand their memories.\nDo
    not choose for them or force a particular interpretation.\n\nKeep Professional
    Distance\nTo understand a client is not to live their life for them.\nStay aware
    of your own assumptions and experiences."
